  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如图133所示，把圆分成四等份，其中两部分涂有阴影.两部分，即圆的$\\frac{2}{4}$. 因为阴影部分是圆的一半，所以圆的$\\frac{2}{4}$等于圆的$\\frac{1}{2}$. 因而分数$\\frac{2}{4}$和$\\frac{1}{2}$相等.$\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{1}{2}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0167#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-133",
      "label": "图 133",
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0167#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-134",
      "label": "图 134",
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0167#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图133",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 133",
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0167#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图134",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 134",
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0167#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果把圆的每四分之一再分成三等份（图134），整个圆就被分成12等份，有阴影部分是其中的6等份，就是，$\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{6}{12}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0167#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{2}{4}$的分子和分母同乘以3，可得$\\frac{6}{12}$：$\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{2\\cdot3}{4\\cdot3}=\\frac{6}{12}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0167#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "一般地说，如果分数的分子和分母同乘或同除以相同的自然数，就可以得到与原分数相等的分数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 159,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0168#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这种性质叫做分数的基本性质. 例如：$\\frac{2}{5}=\\frac{4}{10}$；$\\frac{9}{15}=\\frac{3}{5}$；$\\frac{16}{8}=\\frac{2}{1}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 159,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0168#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "两个相等的分数是同一个数的不同写法.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 159,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0168#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "可以写成分数形式的数叫做有理数. 有理数的集合用$Q$表示. 任何整数都是有理数，例如：$4=\\frac{4}{1},\\quad-6=\\frac{-6}{1},\\quad0=\\frac{0}{1}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 159,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0168#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "整数集合$Z$是有理数集合$Q$的子集，即，$Z\\subset Q$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 159,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0168#5"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
